# Add "Milk": Add takes some text, called Item in its body.
Define: Add Text (Item)
  Fill the Field "Item" with Item
  Click the Button "Add"

Feature: The grocery list

  Background:
    Given I am Signed-in

  Scenario: Adding things
    When I Add "Milk" to the list
    Then I should See the Cell "Milk"
    And the Field "Item" should be Empty again

  Scenario: Ticking things off
    Given I Add "Eggs" to the list
    When I Check the Checkbox "Bought" Within the Row Containing "Eggs"
    Then the Checkbox "Bought" Within the Row Containing "Eggs" should be Checked

  Scenario: Changing my mind
    Given I Add "Kale"
    And I Add "Bread"
    When I Click the Button "Remove" Within the Row Containing "Kale"
    Then I should Not See the Cell "Kale"
    But I should still See the Cell "Bread"
